 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Does not seem to have NDK kinase activity. Confersprotection from cell death by Bax and alters the cellular levelsof several antioxidant enzymes including Gpx5. May play a role inspermiogenesis by increasing the ability of late-stage spermatidsto eliminate reactive oxygen species (By similarity).{ECO:0000250}.TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Specifically expressed in testis germinalcells.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the NDK family. {ECO:0000305}. COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
